+
+================================================================
+4. FORTS
+================================================================
+                        Fortress   Heavy Fortress
+  Gold                     100          250
+  Days                      30           54
+  Upkeep/day                 2            5
+  Bombardment Defense        4            8        (new)
+  Invasion Defense          30           60        (new)
